# Qwen2.5-VL 目标检测预标注

用于自动驾驶避障预标注，从道路图像中提取 `person`、`vehicle`、`other_obstacle` 的直接标注结果。

## 安装

```bash
cd /home/huace/new_storage/ps_proj/qwen2_5_7B_prelabel
conda run -n vllm pip install -e .
```

如果 `import vllm` 报 `libcudart.so.13`，先补动态库路径：

```bash
export VLLM_ENV=/home/huace/miniconda3/envs/vllm
export LD_LIBRARY_PATH="$VLLM_ENV/lib/python3.12/site-packages/nvidia/cu13/lib:$VLLM_ENV/lib/python3.12/site-packages/nvidia/cuda_runtime/lib:${LD_LIBRARY_PATH:-}"
conda run -n vllm python -c "import vllm; print(vllm.__version__)"
```

## 默认运行

```bash
bash /home/huace/new_storage/ps_proj/qwen2_5_7B_prelabel/scripts/run_left_sample_200.sh
```

等价命令：

```bash
conda run -n vllm qwen25-prelabel /home/huace/new_storage/ps_datasets/custom/left \
  --model-dir /home/huace/new_storage/ps_proj/qwen2_5_7B_prelabel/model_dir \
  --output-dir /home/huace/new_storage/ps_proj/qwen2_5_7B_prelabel/outputs/left_sample_200 \
  --sample-size 200 \
  --seed 20260830
```

## 只看抽样

```bash
PYTHONPATH=src python -m qwen25_prelabel /home/huace/new_storage/ps_datasets/custom/left \
  --output-dir outputs/dry_run_left_200 \
  --sample-size 200 \
  --seed 20260830 \
  --dry-run
```

## 输出

- `sample_manifest.json`
- `annotations.jsonl`
- `samples/<image_stem>/manifest.json`
- `samples/<image_stem>/overlay.png`
- `labels/<image_stem>.txt`
